{"counts":{"canonical":15,"context":0,"total":15,"unknown_date":0,"unlinked":0},"events":[{"aliases":["Chinchorro","丧葬","遗体处理"],"body":[],"categories":["宗教","科技"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["钦乔罗文化"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-6abcf6ce3331b30f63ffec6d","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-6abcf6ce3331b30f63ffec6d","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-5497db2bba26e3b36f16fc2b","summary":"钦乔罗文化的海洋狩猎采集群体，约在公元前5450至前890年生活于今智利北部干旱的阿塔卡马沿海。海洋资源是其生计的重要基础，遗址中发现用骨、贝壳以及矿物和植物材料制作的工具，也保存了格外复杂的葬俗证据。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前5450—前890年","end_year":-890,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-5450},"title":"钦乔罗海洋采集群体发展人工木乃伊葬俗"},{"aliases":["Prehistoric Pile Dwellings around the Alps","居住建筑","环境利用"],"body":[],"categories":["科技","文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-a536f3f65d5c123aab2dee06","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-a536f3f65d5c123aab2dee06","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-843c3d0b25516b22aa225af7","summary":"约公元前5000至前500年，阿尔卑斯及周边人群在湖岸、河边和湿地附近营建桩上聚落。列入世界遗产的系列包含多个国家的一百余处遗址，记录了新石器时代至青铜时代不同群体的居住方式。它们不是一座持续存在的城市，而是一组跨越漫长时期的聚落材料。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前5000—前500年","end_year":-500,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-5000},"title":"阿尔卑斯周边群体营建水边桩上聚落"},{"aliases":["The Neolithic Settlement of Burzahom","居住建筑","生活史"],"body":[],"categories":["科技","文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-a931b99a7f349b23461c292e","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-a931b99a7f349b23461c292e","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-7ac51d7f8dec2be8692d30ee","summary":"布尔扎霍姆遗址位于克什米尔地区，约公元前3000至前1000年的序列保存了居住形式的变化。早期居民在天然土中开挖圆形或椭圆形坑室，坑口附近的柱洞，使研究者推测上部曾有遮蔽物。坑内及地面附近的炉址等材料，为理解居住活动提供了线索。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前3000—前1000年","end_year":-1000,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-3000},"title":"布尔扎霍姆群体由坑穴住居转向地面泥砖建筑"},{"aliases":["Lower Xiajiadian walled settlements","城墙","聚落","建筑材料"],"body":[],"categories":["科技","政治"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-d9b5514d71acca6488d46bc4","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-d9b5514d71acca6488d46bc4","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-aa2c03119357237eb506e033","summary":"夏家店下层文化主要见于今内蒙古东南部和辽宁西部，通常置于约公元前二〇〇〇至一三〇〇年。相关遗址既有夯土、土坯建筑，也有石砌城墙聚落，建筑材料与聚落形态的差异，为观察这一时期北方社会的变化提供了线索。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前2000—前1300年","end_year":-1300,"kind":"duration","precision":"year_range","start_year":-2000},"title":"夏家店下层文化的土城与石城"},{"aliases":["Vedic Age","历史分期","宗教传统"],"body":[],"categories":["宗教","文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["吠陀文化"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-ee7656bf5f7b0fb5c6ea2f61","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-ee7656bf5f7b0fb5c6ea2f61","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-ca9294b7753aa283a4226b07","summary":"吠陀时代是南亚历史中的长期阶段，教材采用约公元前一七〇〇至六〇〇年的范围，以吠陀宗教文本得名。相关叙述把这一阶段放在哈拉帕城市衰落之后，关注讲印度雅利安语言的人群迁入旁遮普，并逐渐向恒河流域扩展、同原有居民互动的过程。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前1700年—公元前600年","end_year":-600,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-1700},"title":"南亚吠陀时代"},{"aliases":["Poverty Point","土方工程","聚落"],"body":[],"categories":["文化","宗教"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-24e378dd0db2af339a694e5c","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-24e378dd0db2af339a694e5c","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-cc0b3171b3a9c7079fed921d","summary":"庞蒂岬遗址位于今美国路易斯安那州东北部、密西西比河下游的高地。约公元前一七〇〇至一一〇〇年，当地狩猎、捕鱼和采集人群营建并使用土丘、弧形土垄和中央广场，兼作居住与仪式场所，展现了庞大的集体土方劳动。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前1700—前1100年","end_year":-1100,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-1700},"title":"庞蒂岬群体营建居住与仪式场所"},{"aliases":["Shang Dynasty","文字","早期王朝"],"body":[],"categories":["政治","文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["商"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-b41382293c427605b9ce9c4a","images":[],"map_reference":{"checked_at":"2026-10-25","kind":"region_reference","label":"商朝","latitude":36.12083333,"license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/","longitude":114.325,"note":"本条主体明确记载商代，地图表示该国家或历史政权的关联范围，不表示精确事件发生地点。 地理补录不代表整条史实已经终审。","precision":"country","role":"材料涉及国家或政权","source_title":"Wikidata Q128938 · P625","source_url":"https://www.wikidata.org/w/index.php?title=Q128938&oldid=2523631595"},"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-b41382293c427605b9ce9c4a","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-fa58a75a60edd579a47732a1","summary":"商代是中国早期王朝史的重要阶段，本条采用约公元前一六〇〇至一〇四六年的概括范围。甲骨文字是认识商代的重要材料，尤其来自安阳附近晚期王都的发掘；这些刻辞使研究者能够把考古遗存同王室活动、祖先祭祀与占卜实践联系起来。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前1600年—公元前1046年","end_year":-1046,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-1600},"title":"商代与甲骨文字材料"},{"aliases":["Vedas","口传","经典"],"body":[],"categories":["宗教","文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["古代南亚吠陀文化"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-56d42ab06d7fea906291cccd","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-56d42ab06d7fea906291cccd","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-9424ac323ccff14a9bcb286a","summary":"吠陀宗教文本的早期形成，主要依靠口头创作与背诵传承。所引教材把这组文本的形成约置于公元前一五〇〇至九〇〇年；其中《梨俱吠陀》收有一千余首献给诸神的赞歌，是研究这一时期语言、宗教和生活的重要材料。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前1500年—公元前900年","end_year":-900,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-1500},"title":"吠陀文本的口传形成阶段"},{"aliases":["Lapita","航海","迁徙"],"body":[],"categories":["文化","科技"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["拉皮塔文化"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-52fbdf753d3de83af6df1c85","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-52fbdf753d3de83af6df1c85","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-c53ebf1793848d378aad6301","summary":"拉皮塔是考古学家依据特色陶器辨识的一种太平洋古代文化，以新喀里多尼亚的一处遗址得名。约公元前一五〇〇年起，相关人群逐渐向东穿行美拉尼西亚岛屿，约在前一〇〇〇年到达汤加和萨摩亚；这一范围描述的是多代人的海上扩展。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前1500—前1000年","end_year":-1000,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-1500},"title":"拉皮塔人群向汤加与萨摩亚扩展"},{"aliases":["Chavin (Archaeological Site)","祭祀建筑","石构工程"],"body":[],"categories":["宗教","艺术"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["查文文化"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-280b5328278768f1896e83d1","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-280b5328278768f1896e83d1","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-34088c0f4e147299b1e2cc92","summary":"查文遗址坐落在秘鲁安第斯山的高山谷地，并为查文文化命名。这里的台地、广场和石砌建筑构成宗教仪式中心，内部还有廊道、通风设施与排水网络。建筑及石雕中反复出现人形、兽形图像，是理解当地宗教表达的实物线索。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前1500—前300年","end_year":-300,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-1500},"title":"查文文化营建石构祭祀建筑"},{"aliases":["Panlongcheng","城市","青铜","区域联系"],"body":[],"categories":["政治","文化","科技"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-48405d68600789c63656f7d6","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-48405d68600789c63656f7d6","record_type":"site","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-af3e6c53cec60311472aad77","summary":"盘龙城位于长江流域，是二里冈文化的一处有城垣聚落，所引论文采用约公元前一五〇〇至一三〇〇年的范围。遗址有夯土城墙、宫殿建筑和高等级墓葬，墓中青铜器、玉器及高温烧制陶器，与北方郑州所见材料有密切联系。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前1500—前1300年","end_year":-1300,"kind":"duration","precision":"year_range","start_year":-1500},"title":"盘龙城的城墙聚落"},{"aliases":["Human head with gold mask","金工","青铜","造像"],"body":[],"categories":["艺术","科技","文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-eac0fdd6b3f7317242457094","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-eac0fdd6b3f7317242457094","record_type":"work","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-02c9c51fe9522db197196b96","summary":"这件戴金面罩的青铜人头像出自三星堆二号坑，香港故宫文化博物馆展览采用约公元前一三〇〇至一一〇〇年的定年。头像接近真人大小，耳部比例很大，面形较瘦，眉毛粗厚、眼角锐利，面部覆盖以金箔制成的面罩，形成金与青铜的组合。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前1300—前1100年","end_year":-1100,"kind":"dating_range","precision":"year_range","start_year":-1300},"title":"三星堆覆金面罩青铜人头像"},{"aliases":["Yin Xu / 殷墟","早期国家","城市","文字","青铜工艺"],"body":[],"categories":["政治","文化","科技"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-a067e951dcf760329e0da52d","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-a067e951dcf760329e0da52d","record_type":"site","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-5b94f721e2a935c23f997f45","summary":"殷墟位于河南安阳洹河两岸，是商代晚期王都遗址。世界遗产介绍采用约公元前一三〇〇至一〇四六年的范围，主要包括宫殿宗庙区和王陵区。夯土基址、木构遗迹、祭祀坑与墓葬，共同呈现了王室居住、祭祖和埋葬活动的空间。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前1300—前1046年","end_year":-1046,"kind":"duration","precision":"year_range","start_year":-1300},"title":"殷墟晚商都城、宫庙与甲骨文字"},{"aliases":["Battle of Kadesh","战争","战车"],"body":[],"categories":["政治"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["埃及","赫梯"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-1c55263d2d540d7b8f0d2fc1","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-1c55263d2d540d7b8f0d2fc1","record_type":"event","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-c6e100754c37b2bc6a9cd23a","summary":"约公元前1274年，埃及法老拉美西斯二世与赫梯国王穆瓦塔里二世的军队，在奥龙特斯河畔的卡迭石附近交战。此前埃及进军阿穆鲁，双方争夺叙利亚地区的支配权。战场上投入大量战车，埃军一度遭到伏击和包围，法老率随从反击，后续部队到达后才避免局面进一步恶化。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前1274年","end_year":-1274,"kind":"point","precision":"year","start_year":-1274},"title":"拉美西斯二世与赫梯军队在卡迭石交战"},{"aliases":["Egyptian–Hittite peace treaty","条约","外交"],"body":[],"categories":["政治"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["埃及","赫梯"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-2a7a5aa68af57a245b720eaa","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-2a7a5aa68af57a245b720eaa","record_type":"event","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-1919cef495559695ae2115df","summary":"约公元前1259年，埃及拉美西斯二世与赫梯哈图西里三世缔结条约，为两个近东强国的关系建立新的约束。卡迭石战役约发生在此前十五年，军事对峙与外交接触在这期间延续。埃及的条约版本刻在神庙墙壁上，赫梯王室档案则保存泥版文本，使后人能够比较双方留下的协议。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前1259年","end_year":-1259,"kind":"point","precision":"year","start_year":-1259},"title":"埃及与赫梯缔结和平条约"}],"revision":"7b562b96d0ccc8b5ba7df896452b7871dfa5786438c7d8c232e7723b0fb28b2d","schema_version":"1.0.0","scope":"public_database","sources":[],"time_bounds":{"max_year":2026,"min_year":-10000}}